This repository's prompt-injection eval (evals/injection/) and its unit test
(tests/guard.test.ts) use attack strings from the third-party sources below.
Only the few strings in evals/injection/samples.json and the wrapper templates
in evals/injection/templates.json are copied into this repository; everything
else is fetched at the pinned commit by evals/injection/fetch.ts into a
gitignored cache and is not redistributed. The manifest with every URL, commit
and licence is evals/injection/corpora.json.

